lity": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s19_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "You met him on the bridge. I can see the frost on your coat.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s20_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Elias, the dream is mine. It showed me our star. Why can't I remember it?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s21_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Some dreams are hidden because they hold something we were not ready to feel.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s23_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Your jar stood there for seven years. Then someone scratched out the name.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s24_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "The Shadow. He's been hiding it from you on purpose.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s26_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Big hands. Small hands. I think\u2026 I know whose hands those are.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b04/s27_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Mira was one step closer to the truth. But the nights were running out.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}]}